WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.800
Open the heat map and look for warmer areas. Satellite surface temperature can help you choose where to walk first. Check the observation date and compare it with current weather.

00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:21.067
Use your field readings to see whether the soil is too dry or too wet. Check salinity separately. A moisture map can help direct your visit, and a soil test can confirm a salt problem.

00:00:21.067 --> 00:00:31.467
If hot weather is expected or there is too little water for establishment, wait for a better window. Compare rotation options in the planner and start with a small cover crop trial.
